# ABI 1.7 + SPACE lighting: an unlit, textured star at the origin (it glows
# and casts no shadow) lights three test globes with the axial tilts of
# Jupiter (3.1), Earth (23.4) and Uranus (97.8 degrees), each spun a
# different amount. The red prime meridian and white caps show each spin
# axis. The globes sit beyond the star, so their lit faces are seen.
size 640 360
camera 0 7 14  0 0 -2  50 0.1 500
lighting space 0.03
clear 0 0 0.01 1
light point 0 0 0  1000  1.0 0.95 0.85  1.4
texture star checker 64 32 16 8  1.0 0.85 0.45  1.0 0.65 0.25
texture globe globe 512 256 mipmaps
sphere_mesh 32 16  1 1 1
mesh_texture star
mesh_unlit
mesh_transform 0 0 0  0 0 1  0  0  1.4
sphere_mesh 48 24  1 1 1
mesh_texture globe
mesh_transform -5.5 0 -2.5  0 0 1  3.1  30  1.1
sphere_mesh 48 24  1 1 1
mesh_texture globe
mesh_transform 0 0 -6  1 0 0  23.44  -90  1.1
sphere_mesh 48 24  1 1 1
mesh_texture globe
mesh_transform 5.5 0 -2.5  0 0 1  97.8  -60  1.1
